      "description": "<p>PM also defends decision to release suspects on bail and expresses ‘complete confidence’ in security services</p><p>There are “strong indications” that Iran played a role in events in which five men were arrested near RAF Fairford in Gloucestershire as part of a terror investigation, Andy Burnham has said.</p><p>Speaking to the media at the end of the Labour party conference in Liverpool, Burnham said he could not give any more details amid a police investigation, but that Iran was believed to be involved.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/sep/30/strong-indications-that-iran-played-role-in-raf-fairford-incident-says-burnham\">Continue reading...</a>",
